cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "dendrotherm-onset: Temperature-threshold estimation from dendrometer data"
abstract: >
  R pipeline for estimating species-specific temperature onset thresholds for
  cambial growth using binomial generalised additive models (GAMs) fitted to
  dendrometer time series. Includes HPC-parallelised hierarchical bootstrapping,
  multi-window sensitivity analysis, and diagnostic tools for concurvity and
  boundary behaviour, applied to 14 temperate tree species in NE Germany.
repository-code: "https://github.com/smiljanicm/dendrotherm-onset"
license: GPL-3.0
